# KEYWORD ROSETTA CONTROL SHELL: AGC / MAIN
# AUTHOR: KEYWORD-ROSETTA GENERATOR
# PURPOSE: DISPATCH EACH PROBE ONCE
# DECOY: THIS SUITE NEVER REACHES CURTAINS AND THE HALT WORD STAYS IN PROSE
		BANK	a

DISPATCH	TC	PROBEBR
PROBEBR		TCF	PROBEIO
		BZF	PROBEIO
PROBEIO		CAF	ZERO
		DSKY
		CHANNEL
		READ
PROBERISK	CA	ZERO
		CURTAINS
		WHIMPER
